%% HAND-CURATED — sys-04 §4.2 retention rules + danger callout.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RetentionScheduler
    participant RetentionWorker
    participant PostgreSQL

    Note over RetentionScheduler: COPPA — transcripts cleared within 24h
    alt postgres_unavailable
        RetentionScheduler->>RetentionWorker: hourly tick — clear transcripts
        RetentionWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE session_turns SET transcript_text=NULL, response_text=NULL WHERE created_at < now() - interval 24h
        PostgreSQL--xRetentionWorker: connection error
        Note over RetentionWorker: emit retention_failure metric, retry next hour
    else partial_batch_failure_retry_next_window
        RetentionScheduler->>RetentionWorker: hourly tick
        RetentionWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE session_turns SET transcript_text=NULL, response_text=NULL WHERE created_at < now() - interval 24h
        PostgreSQL-->>RetentionWorker: rowcount=N partial
        Note over RetentionWorker: log lag, next tick continues
    else success
        RetentionScheduler->>RetentionWorker: hourly tick — clear transcripts
        RetentionWorker->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE session_turns SET transcript_text=NULL, response_text=NULL WHERE created_at < now() - interval 24h
        PostgreSQL-->>RetentionWorker: OK rowcount=N
        RetentionScheduler->>RetentionWorker: daily tick — delete turns
        RetentionWorker->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM session_turns WHERE created_at < now() - interval 30 days
        PostgreSQL-->>RetentionWorker: OK rowcount=M
        RetentionScheduler->>RetentionWorker: daily tick — delete sessions
        RetentionWorker->>PostgreSQL: DELETE FROM sessions WHERE created_at < now() - interval 90 days
        PostgreSQL-->>RetentionWorker: OK rowcount=K
    end
    Note over RetentionScheduler,PostgreSQL: COPPA: transcript_text and response_text nulled at 24h, turn rows deleted at 30d, session rows deleted at 90d
